---
<BaseLayout
  title="Basement Waterproofing in Hixson, TN | Trusted Local Experts"
  description="Expert basement waterproofing, crawl space waterproofing, mold remediation, and foundation repair in Hixson, TN. Free consultations. Call (865) 370-2211."
  schema={schema}
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section
      class="relative min-h-[60dvh] flex items-center bg-[#132043] [background-position:top] md:[background-position:top]"
      style="background-image: url('/images/hero-basement-waterproofing.webp'); background-size: cover;"
    >
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0,0,0,0.55), rgba(0,0,0,0.25));"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 flex justify-center">
        <div class="max-w-3xl w-full text-center">
          <p class="text-white/90 text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4" style="text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.65);">Serving Hixson, Tennessee</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tighter leading-tight mb-6" style="text-shadow: 1px 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.75);">
            Basement Waterproofing in Hixson, TN
          </h1>
          <p class="text-white/75 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-[55ch] mx-auto" style="text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.65);">
            Hixson's hillside terrain, clay-heavy soil, and steep drainage gradients make basement waterproofing a serious concern. Our local team handles it all, from seeping walls to failing sump systems.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <a href="#contact" class="bg-[#2563eb] hover:bg-[#1d4ed8] text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-lg transition-colors active:scale-[0.98]">
              Get a Free Estimate
            </a>
            <a href="tel:8653702211" class="border border-white/70 bg-[#132043]/40 hover:bg-transparent hover:border-white text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-center transition-colors">
              (865) 370-2211
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="bg-white py-20">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#132043] tracking-tighter mb-6">
              Basement Waterproofing Services in Hixson
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Hixson presents some of the most challenging waterproofing conditions in the Chattanooga area. The hillside terrain means that runoff from higher elevations concentrates as it flows downhill, often pooling against the foundations of homes situated on slopes or at the base of grades. Clay-heavy soil compounds the problem by absorbing that water and holding it against the foundation for extended periods.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
              We've worked extensively throughout Hixson's established neighborhoods and newer developments alike. Whether your home sits at the top of a ridge or partway down a slope, the specific drainage path matters — and understanding it is the first step to fixing the moisture problem properly. A solution that works for a flat lot won't necessarily be right for a sloped Hixson property.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              From interior drainage systems and sump pump upgrades to exterior grading corrections and crawl space encapsulation, we design the right system for your specific site. Start with a free consultation — no pressure, no obligation.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#132043] text-2xl mb-1">2010</p>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Founded in Chattanooga</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#132043] text-2xl mb-1">100%</p>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Satisfaction guaranteed</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#132043] text-2xl mb-1">Free</p>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Consultations, no obligation</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-gray-100 text-center">
              <p class="font-bold text-[#132043] text-2xl mb-1">Local</p>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Chattanooga-based team</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services -->
